/Producer (PyPDF2)
/Title (Support\040Vector\040Regression)
/Author (Mariette\040Awad\054\040Rahul\040Khanna)
/Subject (Rooted\040in\040statistical\040learning\040or\040Vapnik\055Chervonenkis\040\050VC\051\040theory\054\040support\040vector\040machines\040\050SVMs\051\040are\040well\040positioned\040to\040generalize\040on\040yet\055to\055be\055seen\040data\056\040The\040SVM\040concepts\040presented\040in\040Chapter\0403\040can\040be\040generalized\040to\040become\040applicable\040to\040regression\040problems\056\040As\040in\040classification\054\040support\040vector\040regression\040\050SVR\051\040is\040characterized\040by\040the\040use\040of\040kernels\054\040sparse\040solution\054\040and\040VC\040control\040of\040the\040margin\040and\040the\040number\040of\040support\040vectors\056\040Although\040less\040popular\040than\040SVM\054\040SVR\040has\040been\040proven\040to\040be\040an\040effective\040tool\040in\040real\055value\040function\040estimation\056\040As\040a\040supervised\055learning\040approach\054\040SVR\040trains\040using\040a\040symmetrical\040loss\040function\054\040which\040equally\040penalizes\040high\040and\040low\040misestimates\056\040Using\040Vapnik\220s\040\055insensitive\040approach\054\040a\040flexible\040tube\040of\040minimal\040radius\040is\040formed\040symmetrically\040around\040the\040estimated\040function\054\040such\040that\040the\040absolute\040values\040of\040errors\040less\040than\040a\040certain\040threshold\040are\040ignored\040both\040above\040and\040below\040the\040estimate\056\040In\040this\040manner\054\040points\040outside\040the\040tube\040are\040penalized\054\040but\040those\040within\040the\040tube\054\040either\040above\040or\040below\040the\040function\054\040receive\040no\040penalty\056\040One\040of\040the\040main\040advantages\040of\040SVR\040is\040that\040its\040computational\040complexity\040does\040not\040depend\040on\040the\040dimensionality\040of\040the\040input\040space\056\040Additionally\054\040it\040has\040excellent\040generalization\040capability\054\040with\040high\040prediction\040accuracy\056)
/Keywords (01\040Jan\0402015\054\040Support\040vector\040machine)
>>
